rota lap 4550, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears; its ear rule, a guard that cannot red guards nothing, reaches one level below the guard into a single leg
think Round-open first, level with the anointed head at 250e7f386a. A stale detached roster pass held the lock at launch_head 43db50051a with its verdict already fixed at tree_moved; verified its cwd through /proc/994912/cwd before sending TERM, per the fleet_call discipline, and waited out its own EXIT trap rather than reaching for SIGKILL.
think Aether listens for the page nobody answered. Surveyed my lane's 41 rostered guards for a control: three carried none. Reading tools/m/mantra_gen_floor_a1_gate_witness.rish showed why that mattered -- tools/g/glow_run_worker.sh echoes EXIT:$? after every desk run, so assert reserved.out contains "0" reads true off the trailer however the desk answered.
think Census across 2,470 tracked .rish runners: worker-bound names, then substring assertions whose needle stands inside EXIT:0 and is not EXIT:0 itself. 39 legs in 22 files, 11 of them mine. Every one of my eleven says did not speak 0 -- the refusing side of a bound, which is the one side that most needs to be heard.
think Proved it on metal before changing a line. A pen copy of gate-mantra-gen-floor-u32.glow with 0 answering 7 printed 7 then EXIT:0; the elder leg passed and the exact list read refused. The plant sat in .lap/, which is ignored and so outside the runner's tree digest -- no tracked byte moved while the cold pass ran.
think The repair is Rishi's own list membership, which is exact: (lines x.out) contains "0". Eleven legs in nine files; all nine witnesses re-run GREEN on the honest tree.
obs My first census read 17 legs in 8 files. It ran through tee into head -40, and head's exit sent SIGPIPE back up the pipeline and killed the producer mid-corpus -- a truncating reader reported its own truncation as the finding. Re-run without it: 39 in 22. Measured twice before anything was built.
obs The sibling guard self_matching_assert reads the other borrowed-evidence source, a needle the command operand handed the tool. Its min_needle of 3 passes over the one-character needle that carries almost all of this family, so neither guard can see the other's subject. Both headers now say so.
obs Reds first met a wall: construction/REDS.md reads 40,957 of 40,960 with every row OPEN, so no row can be booked. Named on the card instead, the third lap running to do so.
obs The 28 legs standing outside my lane sit in aurora, caravan, comlink, glow, lantern and rishi rooms. Gating them would red on work no lap of mine may repair, so the lane is walled at zero and the rest ratchets under a ceiling that only falls.
